WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:08.000
SCP-682 Vs SCP-524. The Hard to Destroy&nbsp;
Reptile Vs The cuddly wittle bunny named Walter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.920
that can eat pretty much everything.&nbsp;
Does 682 look enough like a big,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.240
angry carrot for Walter to get the job done?

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.240
682 regarded Walter with suspicion&nbsp;
as the bunny approached. It then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.880
began gnawing through 682’s leg, causing&nbsp;
the giant monster to bellow and flee.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.240
He chased 682 around the containment chamber&nbsp;
for several minutes, before 682 tapped out.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.040
682 climbed up the wall of&nbsp;
the test chamber and waited,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:35.120
while Walter washed his face with his&nbsp;
paws. 524 then began chewing his way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.880
through the wall of the test chamber, at&nbsp;
which point, the experiment was aborted.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.440
Still, very good try, little buddy.

